    <item>
      <title>WEISUN History and Background: From OEM to Own Brand</title>
      <link>https://smp.wei-sun-oven.com/en/company-info/history-and-background/</link>
      <pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      
      <guid>https://smp.wei-sun-oven.com/en/company-info/history-and-background/</guid>
      <description>&lt;h2 class=&#34;relative group&#34;&gt;A Taiwan drying equipment maker since 1976 
    &lt;div id=&#34;a-taiwan-drying-equipment-maker-since-1976&#34; class=&#34;anchor&#34;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
    
    &lt;span
        class=&#34;absolute top-0 w-6 transition-opacity opacity-0 ltr:-left-6 rtl:-right-6 not-prose group-hover:opacity-100 select-none&#34;&gt;
        &lt;a class=&#34;group-hover:text-primary-300 dark:group-hover:text-neutral-700 !no-underline&#34; href=&#34;#a-taiwan-drying-equipment-maker-since-1976&#34; aria-label=&#34;Anchor&#34;&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;
    &lt;/span&gt;        
    
&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WEISUN INDUSTRIAL CO., LTD. began in 1976 as an OEM manufacturer for domestic drying equipment companies. Over five decades it moved from contract manufacturing to an own brand, added semiconductor and electronics process capabilities, and built a product line that now covers clean room, inert gas, pressure, high-temperature, conveyor, environmental testing, and automation equipment.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
      
    </item>
    
